  "description": "Proposed works comprise refurbishment and alteration of ground and lower ground floors of existing single-family dwelling, including construction of a single-storey glazed infill rear extension at ground floor level. At ground floor level, proposals include a contemporary glazed infill extension to form a new dining area, a remodelled kitchen with island, removal of the existing WC and provision of integrated storage, installation of an internal glazed screen between entrance hall and living room, removal of internal entrance lobby doors, and associated refurbishment works. At lower ground floor level, proposals comprise internal reconfiguration to create an improved family living space, replacement of existing rear elevation glazing with full-width aluminium sliding door system incorporating Crittall-style glazing bars, structural alterations, replacement of existing WC and associated internal refurbishment. Works are confined to the rear and interior of the property. No alterations are proposed to principal front elevation or roof.",
